Reinstall BusyBox Inside the Chroot Environment

1. Re-install BusyBox applets to ensure all system utilities (ls, cat, sh, vi) are cleanly symlinked:

`busybox --install -s /bin`

2. Verify essential applet symlinks are functional:

`ls -l /bin/sh`
`ls -l /bin/ls`

3. Test core functionality inside the target environment:

`busybox | head -n 10`
